# Roster — standalone (no longer a tab module). Loads after the other
# modules so it can read their Scanner.results at broadcast time. Comms
# precedes Init because Init registers subprefix handlers against
# MC.Comms; Bitmap precedes Init so v2 broadcast logic can use it.
